    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "141F4EB4A3D0D70C",
      "text": "好的。\\n我就有什么问什么了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "141F4FB4A3D0D8BF",
      "text": "这样下去的话，\\n你们所有人都会受到退学处分吧。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "1422DCB4A3D3FE2D",
      "text": "为什么不解散天星队，\\n然后去学院上学？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_23",
      "hash64": "B7B9762A841D36FC",
      "text": "偏要问这个？\\n我们只是在等一个伙计。\\r\\n……虽然不知道这个伙计会不会回来。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "1422DBB4A3D3FC7A",
      "text": "伙计……是很重要的伙伴吗？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_24",
      "hash64": "B7B9752A841D3549",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "1422DAB4A3D3FAC7",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_25",
      "hash64": "B7B9742A841D3396",
      "text": "是天星队内最强的老大。\\n以训练家来说，类似首席冠军？[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_26",
      "hash64": "B7B9732A841D31E3",
      "text": "这个人邀请大家一起创建天星队，\\n被大家称为真老大。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "1422D9B4A3D3F914",
      "text": "这个真老大现在在哪里？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_27",
      "hash64": "B7B9722A841D3030",
      "text": "要是知道在哪里就不愁了。\\n有一年半左右了？想联系都联系不上。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "1422D8B4A3D3F761",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_28",
      "hash64": "B7B9812A841D49AD",
      "text": "我一直认为如果不退出天星队的话，\\n真老大说不定哪天就联系我了。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_29",
      "hash64": "B7B9802A841D47FA",
      "text": "老师们一直啰嗦着让我退队，\\n还会出现像你们这样的家伙……[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "1422D7B4A3D3F5AE",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_30",
      "hash64": "B7B5F32A841A228C",
      "text": "反倒是我被抛弃了吗……\\n而且真老大以前就想解散天星队……[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "1422D6B4A3D3F3FB",
      "text": "真老大和天星队\\n有那么重要吗？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_31",
      "hash64": "B7B5F42A841A243F",
      "text": "那还用说。\\n以学院来说的话类似……\\r\\n宝物？[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
